<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CNB-120 INDEX RISES 2.6 POINTS TO 895.1 PTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CNB-120 INDEX RISES 2.6 POINTS TO 895.1 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 2.6 points on Monday to 895.1, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Six of the ten sectoral indices lost, but gains to the transport index, which rose 9.6 points, or 0.71 percent, pushed the CNB-120 up.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
